October is Breast Cancer Awareness Month. Women often put the health of their loved ones before their own. Routine cancer screenings, including mammograms, can detect cancer earlier when it’s easier to treat. Schedule your mammogram today if you’re 40 or older.  Your family will thank you for it. 

https://t.co/69HYR14Si1 
@Preventcancer #CongressionalFamilies #BreastCancerAwarenessMonth

